OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 50 charged in
OL,4,Aanti-social biking clampdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 people have been charged
OL,7,Fin the latest crackdown on criminal and
OL,8,Fanti-social biking in Aberdeen.
OL,10,FPolice said the operation targeted
OL,11,Fe-motorcycles, adapted e-bikes and
OL,12,Fe-scooters, as well as petrol
OL,13,Fmotorcycles across the city.
OL,15,FA total of 53 people were charged in
OL,16,Fconnection with a variety of road
OL,17,Ftraffic offences and 38 vehicles were
OL,18,Fseized.
OL,20,FThe clampdown was between 14 September
OL,21,Fand 2 October.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
